<title>UK: BLFA sets $200 million Eurobond due 2001.</title>
<headline>BLFA sets $200 million Eurobond due 2001.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-01-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond was announced by lead manager Societe Generale.</p>
<p> BORROWER   BAYERISCHE LANDESANSTALT FUER AUFBAUFINANZIERUNG</p>
<p> GUARANTOR  STATE OF BAVARIA</p>
<p> AMT    $200 MLN	COUPON     6.25	MATURITY    12.FEB.01</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  101.113   PAY DATE    11.FEB.97</p>
<p> FULL FEES  1.625     REOFFER    99.713    SPREAD	+4 BP</p>
<p> MOODY	AAA	 LISTING    LUX	 PAY FREQ    ANNUAL</p>
<p> S&amp;P	  AAA	 DENOMS (K) 1-10-100  SALE LIMITS =</p>
<p> MGT/UND    0.225     SELL CONC  1.40	PRAECIPUUM  =</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
